1
00:00:00,436 --> 00:00:01,726
(Sheldon:)...here I am.

2
00:00:02,689 --> 00:00:04,899
(Penny:)You just walked in
and they hired you?

3
00:00:05,066 --> 00:00:07,026
(Penny:)-Just like that?
-Oh, heavens no.

4
00:00:07,193 --> 00:00:10,153
(Sheldon:)Since I don't need to be paid,
I didn't need to be hired.

5
00:00:10,321 --> 00:00:13,821
(Sheldon:)I simply came in, picked up a tray
and started working for the man.

6
00:00:14,868 --> 00:00:16,908
(Sheldon:)Let me get that plate out of your way.

7
00:00:17,078 --> 00:00:19,078
(Penny:)Sheldon, this is ridiculous.

8
00:00:19,247 --> 00:00:21,877
(Sheldon:)Is it? Just a moment ago,
I had a minor epiphany...

9
00:00:22,041 --> 00:00:24,211
...regarding polymer degradation
phenomenon...

10
00:00:24,377 --> 00:00:26,587
(Sheldon:)...while scraping congealed nachos
off a plate.

11
00:00:27,839 --> 00:00:30,429
(Sheldon:)-Bernadette, table 10 wants their check.
-Thanks.

12
00:00:30,592 --> 00:00:34,262
(Penny:)Sheldon, wait. This isn't even what I do.
I'm a waitress, not a busboy.

13
00:00:34,929 --> 00:00:36,929
(Sheldon:)You're right. That is more menial.

14
00:00:38,474 --> 00:00:40,684
(Sheldon:)Hello, I'm Sheldon.
I'll be your server today.

15
00:00:41,936 --> 00:00:43,396
(Sheldon:)I don't recommend the salmon.

16
00:00:43,563 --> 00:00:45,693
(Sheldon:)I saw it in the kitchen.

17
00:00:48,401 --> 00:00:51,941
(Sheldon:)All right. One bacon cheeseburger...

18
00:00:52,113 --> 00:00:55,863
(Sheldon:)...breaking two Jewish
dietary restrictions simultaneously.

19
00:00:56,034 --> 00:00:57,914
(Sheldon:)Kudos.

20
00:00:58,077 --> 00:01:00,077
And beer-battered fish and chips.

